## 🎬 PROLOGUE: GAIA'S SHADOW & THE MUD OF FATE (EARLY 2000)

*   **Plot Focus:** An epic, macro-philosophical introduction to the world of Gaia, transitioning smoothly into the intimate, personal focus of a young girl's life at the very beginning of the year 2000.
*   **Narrative Direction:** Begin with a grand, poetic overview of the planet Gaia, sustained by the glowing green life force of the Lifestream. Establish how the world is shifting under Shinra’s industrial grease, creating a cold, gritty environment where fragile human souls are forced to struggle in the mud of desire, manipulation, and survival.
*   **The Global Zoom-In:** From the sweeping view of the decaying southern realm, narrow the focus down through the mountain mists directly into a secluded, unnamed mountain village, freezing the narrative onto the quietest, most vulnerable corner of the world—the warm, isolated interior of a rustic barn (`The_Barn`). Here, in the shadows of the timber and dust, the story silently begins.
